# Auto-activate the Nix dev shell (devShells.default from flake.nix) on entry,
# via direnv. This builds the toolchain and the uv-managed ./venv the first time,
# then nix-direnv caches the environment so later `cd`s into the repo are instant.
#
# Requires direnv with nix-direnv: https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv
# Approve once per checkout (and re-run after editing this file or the flake):
#   direnv allow
use flake
